    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061116.0146\n\nJAKARTA , Nov. 16 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nIndonesian shares close lower\n\n\n\n\nShare prices on the Jakarta Stock Exchange ended lower Thursday with the composite index down 1.29 points to close at 1,668.8 points.\n\nTurnovers totaled 1.9 billion shares worth 2.3 trillion rupiah (246.6 million U.S. dollars).\n\nGainers beat losers 69 to 61, with 80 other issues left unchanged.",
